      ],
      "section": "api_reference",
      "slot": "hub:public_symbol:aspose.page.mcp",
      "text": "The aspose.page.mcp module offers MCP server integration via create_server and run, with handlers in handlers and data types in types supporting ps_to_pdf, ps_to_image, xps_to_pdf, xps_to_image, and eps_metadata operations."
    },
